{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/星海的涟漪","pageid":8801,"revid":21846,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>星海的涟漪</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.98.9F.E6.B5.B7.E7.9A.84.E6.B6.9F.E6.BC.AA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"星海的涟漪\"><b>星海的涟漪</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 星海的涟漪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/05/myfjxgjzeeroi52l77ebhfo2q6n5h1l.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/05/myfjxgjzeeroi52l77ebhfo2q6n5h1l.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%98%9F%E6%B5%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/05/myfjxgjzeeroi52l77ebhfo2q6n5h1l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />星海的涟漪\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）拥有光环，效果：场上所有拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]的己方，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />自身行动结束时，对所有受到本光环影响的己方进行治疗，治疗量为<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>魔攻值，再驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]。<br />自身被击败时，若场上有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]（且没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"归于虚空\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">归于虚空</font></span></span>]），则触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强力不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强力不屈</font></span></span>]，并使最近的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"归于虚空\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">归于虚空</font></span></span>]，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%8F%B2%E5%A8%9C%E5%A1%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/菲娜塔\"><img alt=\"头像 菲娜塔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9a/mbky2xr3jylmg6ukbyu7wjhkeowedjc.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">菲娜塔</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164310\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.436 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.607 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9876/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 161296/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14399/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\